{
  "analysis": "Removing the junk file freed the tmpfs: /root/.cache now shows 100M available (0 used). The remount to 2G failed due to permission denied, but we don't need it — 100M free is plenty for albert-base-v2 (~45MB). Now I'll download the model and tokenizer into the cache.",
  "plan": "Use huggingface_hub's snapshot_download to fetch the full repository (model weights + tokenizer + config) into the default cache, then use transformers AutoModel and AutoTokenizer to ensure all tokenizer config files are also cached. Finally verify offline loading works by setting HF_HUB_OFFLINE / TRANSFORMERS_OFFLINE and re-loading from the cache.",
