  "plan": "1. Remove the partial huggingface cache to reclaim the 100M. 2. Set HF_HUB_DISABLE_XET=1 to force plain HTTP downloads. 3. Retry AutoModel/AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained, which only fetches the needed files (config, tokenizer, one ~47MB weight). Then verify offline loading.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "rm -rf /root/.cache/huggingface && echo CLEANED\n",
