  "plan": "1. Confirm the cached files exist on disk. 2. Set HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1 and TRANSFORMERS_OFFLINE=1 and re-load both AutoModel and AutoTokenizer from cache to prove offline use works. If a forward pass also works, that's a strong signal it's fully usable.",
